# Step 8: REFINE — Iterative Improvement

## Objective
Classify diff against the refine envelope and iterate.

## Refine Categories
- **BUG_FIX** — corrects incorrect behavior
- **PERF** — improves execution speed or resource usage
- **UX** — improves developer experience (CLI, error messages)
- **DOCS** — documentation only
- **SCOPE_CREEP** — outside current phase scope (REJECT)

## Checklist
- [ ] All review comments addressed
- [ ] No scope creep introduced
- [ ] Tests still pass after changes
- [ ] Audit still clean
- [ ] PR description updated
